<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-f419ebb961&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-08-25T19:05:54Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h3>What is AMP?&lt;/h3>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you&#39;re enrolled in CARE or FERA, you may be eligible for up to $8,000 in debt forgiveness through AMP.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Eligible customers who make 12 full monthly payments on time qualify for the full AMP forgiveness.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h3>How does AMP work?&lt;/h3>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>Enroll in AMP.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Complete each on-time and in-full monthly payment.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>PG&amp;amp;E will deduct the amount of &amp;quot;monthly debt eligible for forgiveness&amp;quot; from your monthly bill for the next 12 months.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You need to make 12 full monthly payments on time to qualify for the full AMP forgiveness.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-f419ebb961" class="cmp-text">
    <p> </p>
<h3>What is AMP?</h3>
<p> </p>
<p>If you&#39;re enrolled in CARE or FERA, you may be eligible for up to $8,000 in debt forgiveness through AMP.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Eligible customers who make 12 full monthly payments on time qualify for the full AMP forgiveness.</p>
<p> </p>
<h3>How does AMP work?</h3>
<p> </p>
<ol><li>Enroll in AMP.</li><li>Complete each on-time and in-full monthly payment.</li><li>PG&amp;E will deduct the amount of &#34;monthly debt eligible for forgiveness&#34; from your monthly bill for the next 12 months.</li><li>You need to make 12 full monthly payments on time to qualify for the full AMP forgiveness.</li></ol>

</div>

    

</div>
