         </div>
         <div class="accordion">  <div id="accordion-a7e682cdf6" class="cmp-accordion" data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-29T17:45:16Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
 <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2328fa9752&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;After I am enrolled in AMP, how do I check my enrollment details and current status?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2328fa9752">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2328fa9752-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2328fa9752-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">After I am enrolled in AMP, how do I check my enrollment details and current status?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2328fa9752-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2328fa9752-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-697de7f33d&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-01-28T20:45:57Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/myaccount\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34; rel=\&#34;noopener noreferrer\&#34;>Log in to your PG&amp;amp;E account&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Select &amp;quot;View your Arrearage Management Program&amp;quot; located on the left side of your PG&amp;amp;E account dashboard.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Once selected, your current AMP enrollment details will display in the enrollment detail table.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-697de7f33d" class="cmp-text">
    <ol><li><a href="https://www.pge.com/myaccount" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Log in to your PG&amp;E account</a>.</li><li>Select &#34;View your Arrearage Management Program&#34; located on the left side of your PG&amp;E account dashboard.</li><li>Once selected, your current AMP enrollment details will display in the enrollment detail table.</li></ol>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b7c9418509&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;How many payments are needed to complete the AMP?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b7c9418509">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b7c9418509-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b7c9418509-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">How many payments are needed to complete the AMP?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b7c9418509-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b7c9418509-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-c4f633e800&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-29T17:43:27Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>You need to make 12 full monthly payments on time to qualify for the full AMP forgiveness.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-c4f633e800" class="cmp-text">
    <p>You need to make 12 full monthly payments on time to qualify for the full AMP forgiveness.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-e92f61f124&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;What happens if I miss a payment?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-e92f61f124">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-e92f61f124-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-e92f61f124-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">What happens if I miss a payment?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-e92f61f124-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-e92f61f124-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-f15492cdb1&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-08-25T19:05:37Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>You can miss up to two payments, but they can&#39;t be two months in a row. If you pay both the current bill and the missed payment(s) by the next billing due date, you will stay in the program.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you miss two consecutive payments or three payments in total, you will be withdrawn from the program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-f15492cdb1" class="cmp-text">
    <p>You can miss up to two payments, but they can&#39;t be two months in a row. If you pay both the current bill and the missed payment(s) by the next billing due date, you will stay in the program.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>If you miss two consecutive payments or three payments in total, you will be withdrawn from the program. </p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-509ff2b996&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;What happens if I sign up for AMP, but then can&#39;t keep up with my regular monthly payments?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-509ff2b996">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-509ff2b996-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-509ff2b996-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">What happens if I sign up for AMP, but then can&#39;t keep up with my regular monthly payments?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-509ff2b996-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-509ff2b996-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-06adce0cb3&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-08-25T19:05:29Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>You&#39;ll be unenrolled from AMP. However, you won&#39;t owe any part of the amount already forgiven by AMP.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-06adce0cb3" class="cmp-text">
    <p>You&#39;ll be unenrolled from AMP. However, you won&#39;t owe any part of the amount already forgiven by AMP.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b3de9c1d2e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Is there a maximum amount eligible for debt forgiveness through AMP?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b3de9c1d2e">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b3de9c1d2e-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b3de9c1d2e-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Is there a maximum amount eligible for debt forgiveness through AMP?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b3de9c1d2e-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-b3de9c1d2e-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-11cf65e578&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-09-15T18:51:25Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Yes, the maximum amount eligible for AMP forgiveness is $8,000. If your outstanding balance exceeds $8,000, the remaining balance will be considered an overage. The overage will be &amp;quot;held&amp;quot; separately until the end of the AMP enrollment.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-11cf65e578" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Yes, the maximum amount eligible for AMP forgiveness is $8,000. If your outstanding balance exceeds $8,000, the remaining balance will be considered an overage. The overage will be &#34;held&#34; separately until the end of the AMP enrollment.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-d95f3f5ce8&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;What happens with the remaining amount not forgiven by AMP?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-d95f3f5ce8">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-d95f3f5ce8-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-d95f3f5ce8-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">What happens with the remaining amount not forgiven by AMP?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-d95f3f5ce8-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-d95f3f5ce8-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-05be7bc114&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-01-28T20:46:18Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Your outstanding balance—the amount not forgiven by AMP—will be deferred until you:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>Complete the 12-month AMP program or&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Are unenrolled from the AMP program&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-05be7bc114" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Your outstanding balance—the amount not forgiven by AMP—will be deferred until you:</p>
<ol><li>Complete the 12-month AMP program or</li><li>Are unenrolled from the AMP program</li></ol>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-8762f1ac93&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Can I be on another payment plan and still be eligible for AMP enrollment?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-8762f1ac93">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-8762f1ac93-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-8762f1ac93-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Can I be on another payment plan and still be eligible for AMP enrollment?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-8762f1ac93-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-8762f1ac93-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-2b42d34434&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-02-23T18:37:00Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Yes, but you can only be on one payment plan at a time. Your existing pay plan will be cancelled prior to AMP enrollment.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-2b42d34434" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Yes, but you can only be on one payment plan at a time. Your existing pay plan will be cancelled prior to AMP enrollment.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-4574d626d9&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Can I sign up again after completing the AMP program?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-4574d626d9">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-4574d626d9-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-4574d626d9-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Can I sign up again after completing the AMP program?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-4574d626d9-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-4574d626d9-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-7075afa7a8&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-02-23T18:37:24Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Per the rules of the program, customers must wait 12 months after their last AMP-enrolled payment to re-enroll.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-7075afa7a8" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Per the rules of the program, customers must wait 12 months after their last AMP-enrolled payment to re-enroll.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-84c8e2bd88&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Are Community Choice Aggregation (CCA) customers still eligible to participate in AMP?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-84c8e2bd88">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-84c8e2bd88-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-84c8e2bd88-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Are Community Choice Aggregation (CCA) customers still eligible to participate in AMP?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-84c8e2bd88-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-84c8e2bd88-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-fdd3373cf1&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-02-23T18:49:03Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Yes, &lt;a href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/account/alternate-energy-providers/community-choice-aggregation.html\&#34;>CCA customers&lt;/a> are eligible to participate. However, they must meet the qualifications listed above under &amp;quot;Who is eligible?&amp;quot; and their CCA must agree to participate. If your CCA is participating, then both your PG&amp;amp;E charges and your CCA balances will be eligible for the program. If your CCA is not offering AMP, then only PG&amp;amp;E&#39;s charges will be eligible for forgiveness. The charges from your CCA do not qualify for this program. To learn more, contact your CCA provider.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-fdd3373cf1" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Yes, <a href="/en/account/alternate-energy-providers/community-choice-aggregation.html">CCA customers</a> are eligible to participate. However, they must meet the qualifications listed above under &#34;Who is eligible?&#34; and their CCA must agree to participate. If your CCA is participating, then both your PG&amp;E charges and your CCA balances will be eligible for the program. If your CCA is not offering AMP, then only PG&amp;E&#39;s charges will be eligible for forgiveness. The charges from your CCA do not qualify for this program. To learn more, contact your CCA provider.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-bbad3710e3&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Are Core Transport Agent (CTA) customers eligible to participate in AMP?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-bbad3710e3">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-bbad3710e3-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-bbad3710e3-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Are Core Transport Agent (CTA) customers eligible to participate in AMP?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-bbad3710e3-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-bbad3710e3-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-1bb6a7517e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-02-23T18:49:38Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Yes, but only partially. The PG&amp;amp;E charges will be eligible for forgiveness for qualified customers. However, the monthly gas charges from your CTA are not included in the AMP eligibility calculations.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-1bb6a7517e" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Yes, but only partially. The PG&amp;E charges will be eligible for forgiveness for qualified customers. However, the monthly gas charges from your CTA are not included in the AMP eligibility calculations.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-3fd6ba3380&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Are Direct Access (DA) customers eligible to participate in AMP?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-3fd6ba3380">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-3fd6ba3380-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-3fd6ba3380-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Are Direct Access (DA) customers eligible to participate in AMP?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-3fd6ba3380-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-3fd6ba3380-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-5df936f2d1&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-02-23T18:50:08Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Yes, but only partially. Electric Service Provider&#39;s (ESP) electricity commodity charges are not included in the AMP eligibility calculations.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-5df936f2d1" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Yes, but only partially. Electric Service Provider&#39;s (ESP) electricity commodity charges are not included in the AMP eligibility calculations.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-92e58abc05&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Can I also participate in the Relief for Energy Assistance through Community Help (REACH) and Low-Income Home Energy Assistance Program (LIHEAP) programs if I am enrolled in AMP?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-92e58abc05">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-92e58abc05-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-92e58abc05-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Can I also participate in the Relief for Energy Assistance through Community Help (REACH) and Low-Income Home Energy Assistance Program (LIHEAP) programs if I am enrolled in AMP?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-92e58abc05-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-92e58abc05-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-75fe3fbe51&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-08-25T19:06:37Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Yes, you can participate in LIHEAP. Any financial assistance payments (pledges) from the LIHEAP program would be applied to current charges while enrolled in AMP. However, customers already enrolled in AMP are not eligible to apply for REACH.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-75fe3fbe51" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Yes, you can participate in LIHEAP. Any financial assistance payments (pledges) from the LIHEAP program would be applied to current charges while enrolled in AMP. However, customers already enrolled in AMP are not eligible to apply for REACH.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2363afee79&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;If I am enrolled in AMP and then enroll in LIHEAP, can I use financial assistance payments from LIHEAP to pay my past-due balance?&#34;}}" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2363afee79">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2363afee79-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2363afee79-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">If I am enrolled in AMP and then enroll in LIHEAP, can I use financial assistance payments from LIHEAP to pay my past-due balance?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2363afee79-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-a7e682cdf6-item-2363afee79-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-d5e45b9216&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-09-15T19:03:02Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>No. Your LIHEAP payments apply only to current and future charges. If you are enrolled in AMP, your LIHEAP payments cannot be applied to any debt amount eligible for AMP debt forgiveness.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-d5e45b9216" class="cmp-text">
    <p>No. Your LIHEAP payments apply only to current and future charges. If you are enrolled in AMP, your LIHEAP payments cannot be applied to any debt amount eligible for AMP debt forgiveness.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>

 
</div>
</div>
      </div>
   </div>

</div>

    
</div>

    </div>

    
</div>
